-.TH BTRFSTUNE 8
-.SH NAME
-btrfstune \- tune various filesystem parameters.
-.SH SYNOPSIS
-.B btrfstune [\fIoptions\fP] \fI<device>\fP
-.SH DESCRIPTION
-\fBbtrfstune\fP is used to tune various filesystem parameters,you can
-enable/disable some extended features for btrfs.
